    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="490d439a-31be-5487-8a3c-76f94bb6d613" activityNameId="548106fe-a103-5291-8f1a-3cfc73080633" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Titanium zinc plate, without pre-weathering, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Titanium zinc plate, without pre-weathering, at plant
The production steps pre-alloying, melting, casting, rolling, coiling, stretch forming and cutting are approximated using "casting, brass", "contour brass" and "sheet rolling, aluminium".;
UUID: 726a8d07-564c-34eb-aae9-ad3d4aae3626
The dataset describes the production of titanium zinc alloy from primary zinc and the fabrication of titanium zinc plates with all included fabrication steps. Pre-weathering of the plate is not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Induction furnace for all the pre-alloying and melting steps, roll stands with 5 rolling pairs for the rolling step. Coiling facilities.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 160´000 t/a (Titanium zinc plus refined zinc)
Sampling: Environmental report, certificate 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for the Central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_726a8d07-564c-34eb-aae9-ad3d4aae3626.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="948c6fdb-25b0-54ae-bf5c-e320176f724c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
